WEBVTT

00:09:29.429 --> 00:09:31.357
completely unrecognizable.

00:09:32.073 --> 00:09:34.723
Unless we have a record of these places,

00:09:34.747 --> 00:09:37.224
no one in the future
will know they existed.

00:09:38.182 --> 00:09:40.340
If the earth is the Titanic,

00:09:40.364 --> 00:09:42.213
we've struck the iceberg,

00:09:42.237 --> 00:09:43.767
everyone's on deck

00:09:43.791 --> 00:09:45.524
and the orchestra is playing.

00:09:46.183 --> 00:09:50.957
The climate crisis threatens to destroy
our cultural and ecological patrimony

00:09:50.981 --> 00:09:52.404
within decades.

00:09:52.786 --> 00:09:55.272
But sitting on our hands and doing nothing

00:09:55.296 --> 00:09:56.821
is not an option.

00:09:57.525 --> 00:10:00.597
Shouldn't we save everything
we can on the lifeboats?